      "content": "I am so sorry for the 4-hour outage, and I am deeply sorry that it disrupted your peak window and caused you so much stress. We are taking immediate steps to fix the root cause and will provide a full report by tomorrow morning. Please accept our heartfelt apology and know that we are committed to making this right for Vertex Logistics.",
